<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CSS Demo</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f0f2f5;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .box-model-demo {
            width: 400px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 5px solid #3498db;
            margin: 50px auto;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .box-model-demo h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .box-model-demo p {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 400;
            font-style: italic;
            text-decoration: underline;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555555;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="box-model-demo">
        <h2>Box Model & Text</h2>
        <p>This paragraph demonstrates font styles, weights, sizes, and text decorations combined with standard padding and margins.</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
